    //
    // Compare (row, col) from left to right.
    //
    // From (r, c), possible neighbors are:
    //
    // UP    = (r - 1, c)  -> smaller row -> first
    // LEFT  = (r, c - 1)  -> same row, smaller column
    // RIGHT = (r, c + 1)  -> same row, larger column
    // DOWN  = (r + 1, c)  -> larger row -> last
    //
